      "subject": "שנאי",
      "rationale": "Sipela femail bilong עזרתני\/ונחמתני — tupela strongpela wok wantaim -ני (mi) i stap klostu, pasing i no kamap long Tok Pisin."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Wokim wanpela sain bilong gutpela long mi, na ol i birua long mi bai ol lukim ⟨em⟩ na ol sen. Long wanem, yu, Yahwe, yu halivim mi na yu komfortim mi.",
